\newlabel{tab:taxonomy}{{1}{3}{Five accelerators of gradual disempowerment --- mechanisms through which model propensities and interfaces grow AI taste authority --- organised by the terms in the dynamics above. The ``Layer'' column distinguishes accelerators rooted in interfaces and other deployment choices from those rooted in a model's own propensities. These accelerators can also point in the opposite direction (e.g.\ human-AI switching costs can fall as well as rise). We list the disempowerment-relevant sign}{table.caption.1}{}}
