\newlabel{fig:headline}{{1}{4}{Monthly AI-system participation in GitHub PRs across 10,000{} critical OS software repositories (Apr 2025--Mar 2026). Three series: share of PRs with any AI authored event --- AI bot or AI powered (RQ 1), share of PRs with an AI--AI comment chain of $\geq 5$ contiguous AI bot events (RQ 1), and share of PRs with an explicit AI review (native AI bot \texttt {APPROVED} or \texttt {CHANGES\_REQUESTED} review state; RQ 2). First- and last-month values are annotated on every line. Vertical dotted lines mark approximate public-availability dates of several coding and code-review agents (reader context, not a causal claim)}{figure.caption.2}{}}
\newlabel{fig:headline@cref}{{[figure][1][]1}{[1][3][]4}}
